2253	    // multiple of 8 so per-page boxes land at the right swizzle phase) and a contiguous [.,hkv*hd]
2254	    // row stride. Disabled for fp8 (TIn!=TC ⇒ producer must convert, TMA copies raw bytes).
2255	    // TMA needs 64-col-aligned per-page boxes (KBOX=HD/64); head dims that aren't a multiple of 64
