2259	    // contiguous one-[CN,64]-box path needs CN to compose byte-exactly with the 128B swizzle, which only
2260	    // the validated 48/64/128 do: CN=72 (hd192, would fit at STAGES=3) loads a wrong swizzle -> NaN.
2261	    // hd192/hd256 use CN=64/48 at STAGES=3 (smem-maxed). FA3's wider CN=96/80 at STAGES=2 regressed
2262	    // even on the persistent ring (hd256 0.83->0.59, hd192 0.89->0.76): the 256-deep big-head TMA loads
