2097	// Build a 2D TMA tensor map over a CONTIGUOUS (non-paged) KV cache [total_k, hkv, hd] viewed as
2098	// [total_k (rows), hkv*hd (cols)], box [cn, 64] with 128B swizzle. Mirrors make_kv_map but with no
2099	// page blocking: one [cn,64] box loads a full CN-row key tile per head col-block, landing at the SAME
2100	// swizzled smem offset (bx*CN*64) the wgmma consumer reads. A single [cn,64] box is byte-identical to
2101	// the paged path's CN/block_size stacked [block_size,64] boxes because the 128B swizzle period is 8
2102	// rows and the consumer tile starts at swizzle phase 0 (validated equivalence: koff over CTA_N rows).
2103	// Requires heads contiguous (stride(1)==hd) so the hkv*hd column flatten (col = hk*hd + d) is dense.
2104	template <typename T>
